==English==
[[Image:Phishing Login.jpg|thumb]]
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
From the verb {{m|en|log in}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ˈlɒɡ.ɪn/}}
* {{audio|en|en-us-login.ogg|Audio (US)}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|computing}} A [[combination]] of a [[user]]'s [[identification]] and [[password]] used to enter a [[computer]], [[program]], [[network]], etc.
#: ''I've forgotten my '''login''' again.''
# {{lb|en|computing}} The process of logging in.
#: ''Your '''login''' failed because you weren't connected to the office network.''

